Move the existing XDG-compliant path functions to use `BivvyDirs` for complete centralization:

- `src/cache/mod.rs:17-22` (`default_cache_dir()`) -- delegate to `DEFAULT_DIRS.template_cache_dir()`
- `src/session/mod.rs:18-23` (`default_store_path()`) -- delegate to `DEFAULT_DIRS.sessions_dir()`
